  "nzzSummaryEN": "- Ron Wood, guitarist of the Rolling Stones, performed a concert at the Zurich Volkshaus, which, despite charm and passion, was overshadowed by musical weaknesses.\n- While excelling as a supporting musician, he revealed significant shortcomings as a soloist and vocalist, which even a strong band couldn't fully compensate for.",
